  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agreement on strengthening clinical-laboratory services in Turkmenistan in 2026-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support healthcare services to ensure the availability, accessibility, reliability and modern laboratory analyses for accurate and timely diagnosis of the most common illnesses, including infectious and noncommunicable diseases, surgery, emergency, maternal and child healthcare and others. The project will focus on laboratory capacity in primary healthcare facilities, but will also support secondary and tertiary care facilities.</narrative>
  </description>
